WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.922
It’s project time! Make an interactive story with at least two characters and two scenes.

2
00:00:08.522 --> 00:00:14.104
Make a story with at least two characters and two scenes.

3
00:00:14.104 --> 00:00:20.991
Ask the reader at least one question, and let their answer change the story.

4
00:00:21.591 --> 00:00:27.174
Draw a story map: boxes for scenes and arrows for choices.

5
00:00:27.174 --> 00:00:31.017
Each arrow is labelled with an answer.

6
00:00:31.617 --> 00:00:35.896
Use broadcasts to start scenes and pass turns.

7
00:00:35.896 --> 00:00:40.609
Name messages clearly: “scene 2”, “treasure ending”, “dragon ending”.

8
00:00:41.209 --> 00:00:47.226
A branching story has more than one ending, so test each one.

9
00:00:47.226 --> 00:00:51.939
Ask a friend to try answers you didn’t expect!

10
00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:56.383
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:56.383 --> 00:01:01.530
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
